  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "H\u1EA1t B\u1ED5n Nguy\xEAn...?!! T\u1EA1i sao? T\u1EA1i sao ng\u01B0\u01A1i
      l\u1EA1i t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i ta?!"
    textEN: The Origin Seed...?!! Why? Why have you rejected me?!
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "Hahaha... \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EAFm."
    textEN: Hahahaha... excellent.
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "N\u1EBFu \u0111\xE3 kh\xF4ng ch\u1EA5p nh\u1EADn ta... v\u1EADy th\xEC
      ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i n\u1EEFa!"
    textEN: If you will not accept me, then you have no right to exist!
